=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"Ebh3c_2p\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Striped/Patterned Trousers:</span>&nbsp;Traditional options may feature muted stripes or subtle check patterns, especially for very specific formal day attire like morning dress.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"Ebh3c_2q\" data-hveid=\"CAYQAw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"Ebh3c_2r\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"Ebh3c_2s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Black Dress Pants:</span>&nbsp;A versatile and timeless option, specifically designed for a refined and sophisticated look in professional or evening settings.</span><span jsuid=\"Ebh3c_2t\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;Ebh3c_2t|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"Ebh3c_2t,Ebh3c_2u,Ebh3c_2v\" data-processed=\"true\"><span class=\"vKEkVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;\">&nbsp;</span></span></li></ul>', 800.00, 1200.00, 1, 50, 'featured', '2025-12-01 06:11:35', '2025-12-01 06:11:35'),
(6, 'formal shoes for men', 1, 6, 'Formal shoes prioritize elegance with sleek lines & simple designs meant to dazzle! Men often wear brogues or oxfords while women might wear pumps or heels. The design emphasizes matching well with formal outfits for a polished and uniform appearance...', '<h3 class=\"h2\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 27.7346px; line-height: 1.4; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Merriweather, serif; text-transform: uppercase; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: rgb(28, 28, 28); margin-block-start: 0px !important;\">MEN’S OXFORD SHOES</h3><div class=\"rte\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block-start: 1.25rem; color: rgb(28, 28, 28); font-family: &quot;Untitled Sans&quot;, &quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, sans-serif; margin-block-end: 0px !important;\"><div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block: 0px !important;\"><p style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; text-align: justify; margin-block-start: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block: 0px !important;\">Oxford</span>&nbsp;shoes are among the most well-known formal footwear for men. Named after their popularity within the academic circles of the United Kingdom, this style emerged in the 19th century as an alternative to the boots traditionally worn with formal attire. They are characterised by a closed lacing system, a stitched-in tongue, and a rounded toe. These shoes are ideal for formal occasions such as meetings and even work well as wedding shoes for men.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-block-start: 1.25rem; text-align: justify;\">For a more formal look,&nbsp;<span style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block-start: 0px !important;\">black Oxford shoes&nbsp;</span>are an unfailing choice. If you\'re after a more versatile option,&nbsp;<span style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block-start: 1.25rem;\">brown Oxfords&nbsp;</span>are also a great pick. Church\'s produces some of the most renowned Oxfords. Their footwear has been a staple among aristocrats, academics, and diplomats. Models like the&nbsp;<span style=\"border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-block-start: 1.25rem; margin-block-end: 0px !important;\">Church’s Consul</span>&nbsp;and Diplomat, conceived in 1945, have since become the standard for diplomatic figures and historical leaders such as Winston Churchill...</p></div></div>', 999.00, 1499.00, 1, 21, 'Trending', '2025-12-01 06:23:07', '2025-12-01 06:23:07'),
(7, 'Anarkali Kurtis', 2, 7, 'A kurti is a versatile Indian tunic, typically shorter than a kurta, often hip-length and worn by women for both casual and formal occasions. It\'s made from comfortable fabrics like cotton, silk, or chiffon and comes in various designs, including different necklines and sleeve lengths, and can be decorated with embroidery or prints. Kurtis are popular for being easy to wear and can be styled with traditional bottoms like leggings or palazzos...', '<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_t\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_u\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_v\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Length:</span>&nbsp;Shorter than a traditional kurta, usually ending at or above the hip.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_w\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_x\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_y\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Style:</span>&nbsp;A top or upper-body garment that can have various collar shapes and fits, often more fitted than a kurta.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_z\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_10\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_11\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Fabric:</span>&nbsp;Typically made from lightweight materials such as cotton, silk, or chiffon.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_12\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_13\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_14\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Decoration:</span>&nbsp;Features can range from simple to elaborate, including embroidery, beadwork, and prints.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_15\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_16\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"fLZmjd_17\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Versatility:</span>&nbsp;Can be worn for both casual and formal events, depending on the fabric and embellishments.</span><span jsuid=\"fLZmjd_18\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;fLZmjd_18|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"fLZmjd_18,fLZmjd_19,fLZmjd_1a\" data-processed=\"true\"><span class=\"vKEkVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;\">&nbsp;<button jsuid=\"fLZmjd_1a\" tabindex=\"0\" data-amic=\"tru