(8, 'Tops', 2, 8, 'Pink tops are versatile and feminine garments that come in many styles and shades, such as baby pink, rose, or hot pink. They can be a valuable addition to a wardrobe, suitable for casual outings or more polished looks, and can be paired with a wide range of colors like white, beige, or darker shades of denim. Materials vary, and tops can feature details like lace inserts, textured patterns, or specific necklines and sleeve lengths, depending on the design.', '<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_q\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_r\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_t\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Color:</span>&nbsp;Available in a wide spectrum of pinks, from light, pale shades to vibrant fuchsias.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_u\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_v\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_w\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Versatility:</span>&nbsp;They can be dressed up or down, making them suitable for various occasions, from casual day-to-day wear to more formal events.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_x\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_y\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_z\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Pairing:</span>&nbsp;They can be styled with different colors of pants or skirts, including neutral tones like white or beige, or darker colors like navy or black for a bolder look.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_10\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_11\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_12\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Style Variety:</span>&nbsp;Tops are available in numerous styles, such as t-shirts, blouses, cropped tops, and more, with details that can include different necklines (like round or V-neck), sleeve lengths (short, 3/4th), and embellishments like lace or ruffles.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_13\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_14\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_15\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Material:</span>&nbsp;Common materials include soft polyester, comfortable cotton, and viscose fabric, which can offer a luxurious feel.</span><span jsuid=\"rGiVRc_16\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;rGiVRc_16|n