 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1n\" data-hveid=\"CAUQAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1o\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1p\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Casual:</span>&nbsp;Pair a casual pink top with light-wash denim for a fresh daytime outfit or with white jeans for a crisp summer look.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1q\" data-hveid=\"CAUQAQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1r\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Polished:</span>&nbsp;Tuck a pink top into a sleek pencil skirt or pair it with darker trousers for a more professional or evening-appropriate ensemble.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1t\" data-hveid=\"CAUQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1u\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1v\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Bold:</span>&nbsp;Combine a vibrant fuchsia pink top with darker denim to create a high-contrast look.</span><span jsuid=\"rGiVRc_1w\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;rGiVRc_1w|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"rGiVRc_1w,rGiVRc_1x,rGiVRc_1y\" data-processed=\"true\">