(9, 'Women T-shirts', 2, 8, 'A T-shirt (also spelled tee shirt, or tee for short) is a style of fabric shirt named after the T shape of its body and sleeves. Traditionally, it has short sleeves and a round neckline, known as a crew neck, which lacks a collar...', '<p><span class=\"ILfuVd\" lang=\"en\" style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"hgKElc pOOWX\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 0px 0px;\">A great t-shirt description should&nbsp;<span style=\"border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(211, 227, 253) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%) 75% 0px / 200% 100% no-repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(4, 12, 40); animation: 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.05, 0.7, 0.1, 1) 0.25s 1 normal forwards running highlight;\">provide your audience with all of the information they need about the product you\'re selling</span>. However, it should also tell a unique story about your brand, highlight the key benefits of your products (rather than just the features), and connect with customers on an emotional level...</span></span></p><p><span class=\"ILfuVd\" lang=\"en\" style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"hgKElc pOOWX\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This is one of the easiest ways to give a compliment. You can say this out someone\'s shirt, dress, pants, shoes, etc. It doesn\'t matter if it\'s something they just bought or have had for years. If you think the color looks good on them, let them know!</span></span></span></p>', 300.00, 745.00, 1, 35, 'regular', '2025-12-02 00:03:17', '2025-12-02 00:03:17'),
(10, 'Denim women jeans', 2, 9, 'noun. close-fitting trousers made of blue denim or denimlike fabric, having pockets and seams often reinforced with rivets, and worn originally as work pants but now also as casual attire by persons of all ages.', '<ol class=\"X5LH0c\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">1 “That\'s a Beautiful Color on You” ...</li><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">2 “The Fit is perfect on you” ...</li><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">3 “That Pattern Looks Great” ...</li><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">4 “You Look Comfortable in your Dress” ...</li><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">5 \"You Look like You\'re Having Fun in Your Outfit!\" ...</li><li class=\"TrT0Xe\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">6 I Adore How You Always Have Something New and Unique on Whenever I See You.</li></ol>', 897.00, 1399.00, 1, 88, 'Trending', '2025-12-02 00:13:11', '2025-12-02 00:13:11'),
(11, 'battery car for kids', 3, 10, 'Nice toy Jeep for kids. Ordered it for Sister\'s Son but now already used by my own Son. Product quality is very good as always provided by brand. Front LED lights & Music buttons on steering makes it too attractive for kids to ride it. My son also loves to ride it and busy with it after school. Its totally safe for kids and looks durable because of high quality plastic material used in manufacturing.', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-align: center;\">Our Baybee Speedy Push Ride-on Kids car is designed to look like a car that attracts your kids and they will be excited to ride the car. It comes with a LED Light and Music button. Your baby can play with this car by push mode and control it with the help of a steering wheel or parents can control the car with the help of a push handle. The steering Wheel lets your little ones try controlling the directions of turning Left / Right while going Forward / Backward by the steering wheel. allowing them to ride around objects and tackle corners. The steering wheel also features a horn button they can press to play fun horn sounds while riding. The steering wheel requires 2 x AA batteries (not included). Our push Ride-on Car is constructed with entirely premium virgin PVC plastic material which features non-toxic and odorless. It is secure for your baby to ride on freely. The anti-skid wide tires reduce noise and feature lightweight and shock-absorbing. The four-wheel structure can effectively prevent rollover. The Spacious curved and high backrest support seat will be comfortable for your kids to sit without spine and back pain and with no fear of backflip risk. Our push ride-on car is designed for the utmost comfort of the baby with optimum height and round edges so as not to cause any injury to the kids it can handle a weight maximum of up to 25 kg and is ideal for 1-year to 4-year-old toddlers. It is convenient to carry where ever you go. A smooth and perfect ride-on for your toddlers.</span></p>', 1999.00, 2999.00, 1, 8, 'featured', '2025-12-02 00:31:45', '2025-12-02 00:31:45'),
(12, 'Pink Printed Kurta Pajama Set for kids', 3, 11, 'Bright and cheerful, this pink kurta pajama set for boys features vibrant ethnic prints and stylish buttons. Made from soft, breathable fabric for all-day comfort, itâ€™s perfect for weddings, festivals, and special occasions. Paired with matching mojaris, your little one will steal the spotlight in this adorable traditional outfit.', '<ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 30px; padding: 0px; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; color: rgb(72, 72, 72); font-family: &quot;Shippori Mincho&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.45px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Country of Origin - India</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Category - Boys Ethnic</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Gender - Boy</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Section - Upper</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Pattern Style - Kurta Pajama</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Sleeves - Full Sleeves</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Season - Multi</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Fabric - Imported</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">Washing Care - Gentle Wash</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 72, 72); font-family: &quot;Shippori Mincho&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.45px;\">&lt; This item includes 2 pieces – top and bottom. The MRP shown is for the complete combo</span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(72, 72, 72); font-family: &quot;Shippori Mincho&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.45px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">BS10MUM16</span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(72, 72, 72); font-family: &quot;Shippori Mincho&quot;, serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.45px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Packed Marketed By:</span>&nbsp;Navjeet India Private Limited (Mumkins)<br><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Address:</span>&nbsp;18-A, Moti Nagar CHS Ltd. Junction of Sodawala, Roshan Nagar Road, Borivali (W), Mumbai - 400092, Maharashtra, India</p>', 1175.00, 1899.00, 1, 11, 'featured', '2025-12-02 01:08:00', '2025-12-02 01:08:00'),
(13, 'School Bags for Boys & Girls Waterproof School Backpack', 3, 12, 'School Backpack for Girls, Unicorn Cartoon School Backpack Girls Backpack for School, Travel, Camping, Burden-relief School Backpack for Kids 3-6 Years Old...', '<ul style=\"margin: 10px 0px 30px 15px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: initial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Barlow, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.28px;\"><li style=\"list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;\">CHARMING UNICORN DESIGN: Adorn your childs school adventures with this enchanting unicorn-themed backpack, flaunting vibrant purple hues and delightful patterns. It\'s a magical school backpack that\'s sure to draw smiles and spark imagination at school or while traveling.</li><li style=\"list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;\">OPTIMAL SIZE FOR KIDDOS: The overall size is29x16x36cm, designed with a main compartment, front zipper pouch with lovely cartoon print, 2 side zipper pouch, enough room for books, pencil box, accessories . The built in seperate compartment also can help kids to keep all stationery supplies stay well organized and classfied. Dual zipper design make all items inside more easily accessible.</li><li style=\"list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;\">BURDEN-RELIEF SCHOOL BACKPACK: This new ergonomic school backpack is with more breathable padded back design which not just can reduce the shoulder burden but also make it more comfortable to wear, especially for kids in primary or preschool students. Both back and shoulder strap are padded, more breathable and laborsaving to carry .</li><li style=\"list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;\">DURABLE BACKPACK FOR STUDENTS: This backpack for schoolgirls is crafted with high-quality composite oxford cloth, providing exceptional wear resistance and waterproofing properties for lasting durability. The soft interior lining is made of durable polyester, ensuring longevity and reliability with every use.</li><li style=\"list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;\">IDEAL GIFT FOR YOUNG KIDDOS: This cute large capacity school backpack is definitely a nice gift for kids of 3-6 years old or anyone who is gonna start their school life. Super cute and vibrant design definitely will be loved by kids, making your kids standout in crowds. No matter for carrying textbook for class or belongings for traveling, this cute school backpack is definitely a nice gift for children or kids who are about to go to primary school.</li></ul>', 2071.00, 3000.00, 1, 38, 'featured', '2025-12-02 01:27:20', '2025-12-02 01:27:20');
