(15, 'jeggings for women', 2, 9, 'Jeggings are a hybrid clothing item that combines the stretchy, comfortable fit of leggings with the appearance of denim jeans. They are typically made from a denim-like fabric blend, often with spandex, and may include decorative details like faux pockets, seams, and a fake fly to mimic the look of jeans...', '<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2k\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2l\" data-hveid=\"CAYQAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2m\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2n\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Versatile:</span>&nbsp;Jeggings are a versatile wardrobe staple that can be worn for casual outings like running errands or brunch, or dressed up for a night out.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2o\" data-hveid=\"CAYQAQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2p\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2q\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Casual looks:</span>&nbsp;Pair with loose t-shirts or oversized sweaters.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_2r\" data-hveid=\"CAYQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=