data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_r\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Comfort:</span>&nbsp;Provide the flexibility and comfort of leggings.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_t\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_u\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_v\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Material:</span>&nbsp;Usually a blend of cotton, polyester, and spandex, giving them a snug but stretchable fit.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_w\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_x\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"GJNDPc_y\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Details:</span>&nbsp;Can feature faux pockets, decorative seams, and an elasticized waistband to replicate the style of traditional jeans. Some may have functional pockets and zippers.</span><span jsuid=\"GJNDPc_z\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;GJNDPc_z|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"GJNDPc_z,GJNDPc_10,GJNDPc_11\" data-processed=\"true\"><span class=\"vKEkVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;\">&nbsp;</span></span></li></ul>', 998.00, 1299.00, 1, 79, 'regular', '2025-12-02 06:06:45', '2025-12-02 06:06:45'),
(16, 'Casual Sneaker Shoes for Men | Elegantly Rounded Front, Soothing Insole.', 1, 6, 'Product Specfications:-\r\n\r\nMaterial: Sole - EVA | Upper - PU | Insole material - Memory foam\r\nThese low-cut casual sneaker shoes are a perfect fit and are made up of a memory foam insole. The EVA sole material and round-toe shape gives the perfect classy vibes.\r\nFeatures: Heel Height - Flat | Toe Shape - Round\r\nBenefits: A must-have pair because of the elegance and style it offers, a low-cut pattern with an EVA sole material for a smooth and classy finish.\r\nLifestyle: Sneaker shoes', '<p>Reliable and versatile in shape and design, Red Tape\'s casual sneaker shoes for men are an awesome piece delivering styles that blend with rich materials. A soft low-cut pattern with a durable EVA sole enhances the aesthetic appeal and ensures a snug fit. This fashion revolution in which you can choose comfort and convenience without having to compromise on style and diverse designs.</p><p>Features:</p><ul><li>Simple upkeep: The EVA sole and PU material of the upper add a stylish and contemporary appearance while requiring minimal maintenance.</li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Designed to slay: Crafted from a blend of memory foam insole material, these shoes offer&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;unparalleled stability and relaxing posture.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Surface grip: The memory foam insole and EVA sole material give us firm support on any&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;surface while offering a classy look.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Perfect fit: These men\'s casual shoes are a perfect fit and are made up of a memory foam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;insole.</p><div><br></div>', 759.00, 1000.00, 1, 39, 'Trending', '2025-12-02 06:32:49', '2025-12-02 06:32:49'),
(17, 'Dark Blue Slim Fit Denim Jeans', 1, 5, 'Dark blue jeans are a versatile garment made from denim fabric dyed a deep indigo or blue color. They can be styled for both casual and semi-formal occasions, and are available in various fits such as skinny, straight, and bootcut. Key features include a classic five-pocket design, a button and zip fly, and varying degrees of stretch depending on the blend of cotton and other materials like spandex', '<div class=\"otQkpb\" aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_j\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0px 10px;\">&nbsp;key features<span jsuid=\"vbUtk_k\" class=\"txxDge notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;vbUtk_k|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"vbUtk_k,vbUtk_l,vbUtk_m\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"visibility: hidden;\"><span class=\"vKEkVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;\"><button jsuid=\"vbUtk_m\" tabindex=\"0\" data-amic=\"true\" data-icl-uuid=\"f9a29952-2729-4176-8652-b701d6ccb595\" aria-label=\"View related links\" class=\"rBl3me\" jsaction=\"click:&amp;vbUtk_k|S9kKve;mouseenter:&amp;vbUtk_k|sbHm2b;mouseleave:&amp;vbUtk_k|Tx5Rb\" data-wiz-attrbind=\"disabled=vbUtk_k_C5gNJc;class=vbUtk_k_UpSNec;\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwin8eXA36CRAxWyUGwGHUskCrIQye0OegQIAhAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin-right: 6px; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(229, 237, 255); border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 28px; position: relative; outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"wiMplc ofC0Ud\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); display: inline-block; transform: rotate(135deg);\"><svg style=\"margin-top: 3px;\" fill=\"currentColor\" width=\"12px\" height=\"12px\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z\"></path></svg></span></button></span></span></div><ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_n\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_o\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_p\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_q\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Color:</span>&nbsp;A rich, deep blue achieved through multiple dyeing processes, with some washes having a more dressy \"dark indigo\" hue.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_r\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_s\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_t\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Fabric:</span>&nbsp;Typically made of cotton denim, with some modern versions incorporating spandex for added stretch and comfort.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_u\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_v\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_w\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Fit:</span>&nbsp;Available in a wide range of fits, including:</span><ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_x\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px;\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_y\" data-hveid=\"CAMQAw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: circle; padding-inline-start: 0px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_z\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_10\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Skinny:</span>&nbsp;Close-fitting from hip to ankle.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_11\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: circle; padding-inline-start: 0px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_12\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_13\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Straight:</span>&nbsp;A consistent width from the knee to the ankle.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_14\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBQ\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: circle; padding-inline-start: 0px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_15\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_16\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Bootcut/Flare:</span>&nbsp;Fitted through the thigh and slightly flares out at the hem.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_17\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBg\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: circle; padding-inline-start: 0px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_18\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_19\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Relaxed:</span>&nbsp;A looser, more comfortable fit.</span></li></ul></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1a\" data-hveid=\"CAMQBw\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1b\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1c\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Style:</span>&nbsp;Often features a classic five-pocket design, belt loops, and a button and zip closure.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1d\" data-hveid=\"CAMQCA\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;\"><span class=\"T286Pc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1e\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Yjhzub\" jscontroller=\"VhkxAe\" jsuid=\"vbUtk_1f\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Versatility:</span>&nbsp;Can be dressed up with a sports coat and dress shoes or down with a t-shirt and sneakers.</span><span jsuid=\"vbUtk_1g\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;vbUtk_1g|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"udAs2b\" data-wiz-uids=\"vbUtk_1g,vbUtk_1h,vbUtk_1i\" data-processed=\"true\"><span class=\"vKEkVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-processed=\"true\" style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;\">&nbsp;</span></span></li></ul>', 999.00, 1998.00, 1, 49, 'Trending', '2025-12-03 00:34:02', '2025-12-03 00:34:02'),
(18, 'blue cotton shirts', 1, 4, 'T-shirts are typically made of cotton textile in a stockinette or jersey knit, which has a distinctively pliable texture compared to shirts made of woven cloth. Some modern versions have a body made from a continuously knitted tube, produced on a circular knitting machine, such that the torso has no side seams.', '<p><span class=\"ILfuVd\" lang=\"en\" style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"hgKElc pOOWX\" style=\"padding: 0px 8px 0px 0px;\">A good quality t-shirt&nbsp;<span style=\"border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(211, 227, 253) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%) 75% 0px / 200% 100% no-repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(4, 12, 40); animation: 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.05, 0.7, 0.1, 1) 0.25s 1 normal forwards running highlight;\">stays comfortable, fits well, and holds up after many washes</span>. From the fabric to the stitching, every detail matters in creating a t-shirt that looks great and lasts longer.</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">A great t-shirt description should&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(211, 227, 253) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%); background-position: 75% 0px; background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px; color: rgb(4, 12, 40); animation: 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.05, 0.7, 0.1, 1) 0.25s 1 normal forwards running highlight; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">provide your audience with all of the information they need about the product you\'re selling</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">. However, it should also tell a unique story about your brand, highlight the key benefits of your products (rather than just the features), and connect with customers on an emotional level</span></p>', 777.00, 1200.00, 1, 90, 'regular', '2025-12-06 02:23:00', '2025-12-06 02:23:00'),
(19, 'green shirt', 1, 4, 'best green shirts for men', '<p>best cpmfortable shirts for men...</p>', 665.00, 999.00, 1, 99, 'regular', '2025-12-08 05:43:17', '2025-12-08 05:43:17');
